lunasvg / plutovg fixes for nitroview (scripts/get-deps.sh applies this after downloading):
- plutovg_path_parse rejected a repeated closepath ("ZZ", valid SVG) and dropped the rest of
  the path (https://github.com/sammycage/plutovg/pull/90)
- plutovg_surface_create cleared height * stride bytes computed in int (overflow above 2 GB;
  https://github.com/sammycage/plutovg/pull/91 refuses such surfaces instead)
- stb_truetype read past the outline of a glyph whose last contour is a single off-curve
  point (macOS Times "C"; ASan: heap-buffer-overflow in stbtt_GetGlyphShape;
  https://github.com/nothings/stb/issues/1296)
- XML comments inside <text> were drawn as text (https://github.com/sammycage/lunasvg/pull/281)
- the font cache chose condensed or expanded faces as readily as the normal one (macOS Futura:
  Futura Condensed Medium for Futura); with equal bold / italic the normal width wins now
- macOS: the user's fonts (~/Library/Fonts, where Font Book installs) are loaded too

